// V5's own "Images and sampling" milestone: exercises the object model this
// milestone lands -- image/view/sampler creation, `vkCmdCopyBufferToImage`,
// a "compatible formats" `vkCmdCopyImage` between two differently-typed but
// texel-size-compatible images, and `vkCmdCopyImageToBuffer` -- through the
// real Khronos loader rather than only `unittests/Vulkan/ImageTest.cpp`'s
// direct `libfeme_vulkan` linkage (see "Testing Strategy" in
// feme/docs/FeMeVulkanDesign.md and this milestone's own "Deliberately
// deferred" agent-thoughts note on why no such test existed before). No
// shader consumes the image -- that remains R30's own remaining scope (see
// FeMeVulkanDesign.md's "V5" deviation note) -- so this only round-trips
// bytes through copies.
//
// REQUIRES: system-vulkan-loader
// RUN: env VK_DRIVER_FILES=%feme_vulkan_icd_manifest VK_LOADER_DEBUG=error \
// RUN:   feme-vulkan-image-loader-smoke | FileCheck %s

